			<div class="content" id="post-content-4831476">
									

<p>Apologies for the needless edge, I based the idea on a nightmare I had and rushed into it. The idea was that the doll was based on the &quot;yandere&quot; anime trope, and I planned to expand on that in the experiment logs with incidents such as a victim being brought out of the trance only to be butchered the next time he goes in, with the implication being that the doll doesn't like being &quot;abandoned&quot;. But I really like the cultural appropriation idea, what if instead of a lonely Japanese man it's a Western otaku who ends up being killed by it due to messing with things he doesn't truly understand?</p>

							</div>

								
					
